# The per-agent outputs are inputs to a merge step whose merged output IS
# vendored: essays/ -> opus5_agent.jsonl (build_jsonl.py), and
# recitation/answers/ -> recitation_opus5_agent.csv (score_recitation.py), both
# of which carry the answer text verbatim. Tracking both forms put 481 files
# into every diff for a second copy of the same bytes.
#
# They stay on disk when you re-generate, and the merge steps read them from
# here; they are simply not the repository's copy of the record.
essays/
recitation/answers/
recitation/prompts/
